# Asset files must reach the browser byte-for-byte. Without this, Git's
# autocrlf rewrites line endings inside the .gltf files on checkout — they are
# JSON so it parses either way, but it rewrites megabytes of embedded base64
# for no reason and makes every diff look like the whole model changed.
*.gltf   -text
*.glb    binary
*.fbx    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.wav    binary
